---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Dental Services in Tempe, AZ"
description: "Complete dental services at 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ — dental implants, All-on-4 / All-on-X full-arch reconstruction, family dentistry, cosmetic dentistry, emergency care, and more. Led by Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS."
permalink: /services/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Services", url: "/services/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Services</div>
    <h1>Complete Dental Care, <span>One Trusted Team</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">3rd Set Smiles is a full-service general and implant-focused dental practice in Tempe, Arizona. Whether you need a cleaning, a crown, a new set of teeth, or anything in between, you'll see the same doctor and the same team every visit.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Request an Appointment</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# Hub sections are driven by src/_data/serviceCategories.js so a category
   typo in a service file can't silently drop it — see the Uncategorized
   section below, which surfaces any service whose key matches no group. #}
{% for cat in serviceCategories %}
<section class="section{% if loop.index0 % 2 == 1 %} section-cream{% endif %}">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in" style="margin-bottom:36px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--navy)">{{ cat.label }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ cat.blurb }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-list-grid">
      {% for s in collections.services %}
        {% if s.data.serviceMeta.category == cat.key %}
          <a class="service-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
            <span class="service-name">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.label }}</span>
            <span class="service-blurb">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.shortBlurb }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

{# Safety net: any service whose category key doesn't match a group above is
   rendered here instead of vanishing. This block should stay empty. #}
{% set knownKeys = [] %}
{% for cat in serviceCategories %}{% set knownKeys = (knownKeys.push(cat.key), knownKeys) %}{% endfor %}
{% set uncategorized = [] %}
{% for s in collections.services %}
  {% if s.data.serviceMeta.category not in knownKeys %}
    {% set uncategorized = (uncategorized.push(s), uncategorized) %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if uncategorized.length %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in" style="margin-bottom:36px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--navy)">Uncategorized</h2>
      <p class="muted">These services have a category that doesn't match a known group &mdash; fix the <code>serviceMeta.category</code> key.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-list-grid">
      {% for s in uncategorized %}
        <a class="service-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
          <span class="service-name">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.label }}</span>
          <span class="service-blurb">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.shortBlurb }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what's going on and we'll help you figure out the right next step. Most consultations are quick and there's never any pressure.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Request an Appointment</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
